# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, CSI_V2_DB, and SUPABASE_DB_URL all now live in the canonical
# repo-root .env.example -- see there, not here.
#
# The one plan_reader-specific note: 01_pipeline/s3_extract.py, when run standalone
# (outside apps/api, which already has ANTHROPIC_API_KEY via the root .env in-process),
# falls back to reading pipelines/plan_reader/.env directly if ANTHROPIC_API_KEY isn't
# already in the environment. If you need that standalone path to work, either export
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY into your shell first (set -a; source ../../.env; set +a) or create
# a local pipelines/plan_reader/.env with just that one key.
